    <string name="dejavu_tab_sleep_hint">Aseksel yeṭṭsen yesserraḥ takatut-is, syin yessali-d tasna-s tikkelt-nniḍen mi ara t-terẓmeḍ. Aseksel i tettwaliḍ, win i s-d-yezgan g tmuɣli tabḍant, akked iseksal i d-yessuffuɣen ameslaw neɣ i yesseqdacen takamiṛat neɣ asawaḍ ur ṭṭsen ara. Ma yesra Android takatut mi ara yili Dejavu g ugilal, iseksal akkʷ ad ṭṭsen, ala sin i tesseqdceḍ taneggarut.</string>
