    <string name="dejavu_settings_close_pinned_hint">Ɣef iseksal yessersen d ikuramen, “Mdel” ad yesṭṭes iseksal yeldin, acku iseksal yessersen ttqimen. Mi ara yeṭṭes useksel yessersen, “Mdel” ad as-yekkes asers.</string>
