    <string name="dejavu_sync_choose_about">Sdukel imukan n umahil-ik akked Firefox neɣ Zen Browser ɣef uselkim-ik, s umiḍan Mozilla i deg tesdukkuleḍ isefka-k n Firefox.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_firefox_about">Yesskan-d iseksal yeldin n Firefox ɣef yal aselkim-ik am umkan n umahil, yerna yettleqqim-iten yal tikkelt. Yesseqdac amiḍan Mozilla i deg tesdukkuleḍ isefka-k n Firefox.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_firefox_hint">Deg Firefox ɣef uselkim-ik, rẓem Tisɣal, sakin Asdukel, rnu eǧǧ “Rẓem iseksal” yermed. Iseksal i teldiḍ deg Dejavu qqimen ɣef yibenk-agi, yerna Firefox yesskan-iten-id ddaw ibenkan-ik nniḍen.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_normal_tabs_firefox_summary">Yesskan-d daɣ iseksal ur yessersen ara, ur llin ara deg ugraw n iseksal, maci kan iseksal yessersen d igrawen n iseksal.</string>
