    <string name="dejavu_sync_firefox_summary">Yal aselkim s Firefox yesɛa amkan-is n umahil: iseksal yessersen qqimen yessersen, igrawen n iseksal uɣalen d ikuramen, iseksal-is nniḍen ttildin dinna. Ma tmedleḍ da yiwen seg iseksal-is, ad yemdel daɣen ɣef uselkim.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_zen_summary">Imukan n umahil, iseksal yessersen, ayen ilaqen d ikuramen qqimen am wamek llan deg Zen akked Dejavu, deg sin yidisan.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_switch_from_zen">Imukan n umahil seg Zen qqimen deg Dejavu, maca ur ttwasdukklen ara sya ɣer zdat.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_switch_from_firefox">Imukan n umahil n iselkimen-ik s Firefox ad ffɣen seg Dejavu. Iseksal-nsen ad qqimen deg Firefox.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_choose">Asdukel yettwaḥbes alamma tferneḍ Firefox neɣ Zen.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_tabs_off">Asdukel n “Rẓem iseksal” yensa i umiḍan-ik Mozilla. Sermed “Rẓem iseksal” deg tisɣal n usdukel n umiḍan-ik, da neɣ deg Firefox.</string>
    <string name="dejavu_sync_problem_no_firefox">Mazal ulac Firefox ɣef uselkim i yesdukkulen iseksal-is yeldin ɣer umiḍan-ik.</string>
